Package: rladybugdb
Title: R Interface to the 'LadybugDB' Embedded Graph Database
Version: 0.4.4
Authors@R: c( person("Raden Muhammad", "Hadi", email =
        "hadimaster65555@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")) )
Description: Provides an R interface to 'LadybugDB', an embedded
        columnar graph database using the 'Cypher' query language.
        'LadybugDB' was formerly known as 'Kuzu'. This package uses
        native 'Rcpp' bindings to the 'LadybugDB' C library, requiring
        no 'Python' runtime.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: C++20, CMake (>= 3.15)
Imports: DBI (>= 1.2.0), methods, Rcpp (>= 1.0.0), rlang (>= 1.0.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: arrow, bit64, DBItest, tibble, igraph, tidygraph, testthat
        (>= 3.0.0), withr, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
